# Model weights and media are too large for git
*.pt
# ...except the three the inference entry points load by default, so a clone of this
# repo can run both parts without retraining. 30 MB total; the ablation checkpoints
# stay out, and so do the videos - except the counted output video, which is force-added and
# stored with Git LFS (see .gitattributes): 111 MB is over GitHub's 100 MB plain-file limit.
!runs/mobilenet_multi_unfreeze/best.pt
!runs/yolo/finetune/weights/best.pt
!yolo11n.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov

